@host = http://localhost:7071/api

### Part A: Employee CRUD

### 1. Get All Employees
GET {{host}}/employees

### 2. Get Employee by ID
GET {{host}}/employees/1

### 3. Create Employee
POST {{host}}/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "departmentId": 1,
    "salary": 75000,
    "bonus": 5000,
    "hireDate": "2024-01-15T00:00:00"
}

### 4. Update Employee
PUT {{host}}/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Arjun",
    "lastName": "Sharma",
    "departmentId": 1,
    "salary": 125000,
    "bonus": 360000,
    "hireDate": "2020-01-15T00:00:00"
}

### 5. Delete Employee
DELETE {{host}}/employees/999


### Part B: Compensation Reports

### B.1 - Total Bonus Paid
GET {{host}}/reports/total-bonus

### B.2 - Employees With No Bonus
GET {{host}}/reports/no-bonus

### B.3 - Bonus as Percentage of Salary
GET {{host}}/reports/bonus-percentages

### B.4 - Departments Where Total Bonus Exceeds Average Salary
GET {{host}}/reports/department-bonus-flag

### B.5 - Employees Ranked by Bonus (Nulls Last)
GET {{host}}/reports/ranked-by-bonus

### B.6 - Top Compensation Analysis
GET {{host}}/reports/top-compensation
